			title: "Sirius B on AE2"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 16.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3622F47EE2F048E9"]
			description: ["The &6Extraction Cascade&r, &6Cryogenic Plant&r, &6Platinum Plant&r, &6Fluorspar Kiln&r, &6Syngas Plant&r and &6Methane Pyrolyser&r each take a new mode: hafnium and tantalum thiocyanate, interstellar gas distillation, barnard residue, hydrogen fluoride, CO-rich syngas and carbon nanotubes. The controllers you already own, and the gas and residue from the stars. Pure refractory metals, xenon and helium-3, ruthenium and iridium, the Mond route on Barnard b. Each plant hands its product on by pipe. Return the helium ash and the calcium fluoride."]
			icon: "gtceu:extraction_cascade"
			id: "531661D4F43C18E5"
