		{
			dependencies: ["3622F47EE2F048E9"]
			description: ["The &6Hot Cell&r, &6Fuel Fabrication Plant&r, &6Actinide Partitioning Plant&r, &6High Flux Reactor&r, &6Transuranium Facility&r and &6Isotope Column&r take targets, a depleted-plutonium fuel, new cuts of plutonium, curium and californium, and boron-11 fluoride. The reactors from UHV and the isotope feed. The calutron's feed, the superheavy targets and the boron for the aneutronic burn. Targets and cuts move by bus; the decay store gives helium-3 back to the cryogenic plant."]
			icon: "gtceu:hot_cell"
