		{
			dependencies: ["3622F47EE2F048E9"]
			description: ["The &6Diamond Lattice Fab&r, &6Ion Implanter&r, &6Powder-in-Tube Line&r, &6Boron Nitride Reactor&r, &6Synchrotron&r and &6Zone Refining Tower&r each take a mode for the era: nanodiamond, drift rings, superhydride wire, a boron nitride film, silicon nitride lithography and float-zone silicon. The UV versions you own, and the new purities. The detectors, the fibre and the photonic chips. Boules and films by bus; recycle what the tower rejects."]
