		{
			dependencies: ["3622F47EE2F048E9"]
			description: ["The &6Fibre Draw Tower&r, &6MBE Reactor&r, &6Photonic Foundry&r, &6Crystal Growth Furnace&r and &6Spark Plasma Sinterer&r take a new mode each: ytterbium and hollow-core fibre, quantum dots, silicon nitride chips, a garnet and a flux crystal, and the hafnium coil ceramic. The UHV controllers and the iridium crucible. The cooling lasers, the quantum photonic chip and the HfTaCN coil. Crystals and chips by bus; recycle the flux."]
